      "start_seconds": 0.68,
      "end_seconds": 3.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.27,
      "end_seconds": 8.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Afternoon, you know, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.42,
      "end_seconds": 13.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.2,
      "end_seconds": 20.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "It's three early losses, mostly. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.45,
      "end_seconds": 25.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Alright, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.49,
      "end_seconds": 36.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "I've had it for about a week. I've been reading about it it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.6,
      "end_seconds": 37.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.64,
      "end_seconds": 44.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling low and anxious too, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.39,
      "end_seconds": 47.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.42,
      "end_seconds": 51.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.91,
      "end_seconds": 64.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Any clotting problem or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.08,
      "end_seconds": 68.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.9,
      "end_seconds": 73.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.23,
      "end_seconds": 79.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, um, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.25,
      "end_seconds": 84.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.09,
      "end_seconds": 89.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.34,
      "end_seconds": 94.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.07,
      "end_seconds": 109.13,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "Furosemide. I take it 40 milligrams, every morning for the fluid. Folic acid. I take it 400 micrograms, daily. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.19,
      "end_seconds": 111.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.61,
      "end_seconds": 115.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.42,
      "end_seconds": 118.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.11,
      "end_seconds": 123.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.3,
      "end_seconds": 126.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.02,
      "end_seconds": 132.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
